        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cast iron, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cast iron, at plant
35% scrap and 65% pig iron assumed as iron input;
Synonyms: grey iron, white iron, Grauguss; 
UUID: ea445393-9bd6-3cf6-932d-b73f3d415bce
Transports of metal and other input materials to electric arc furnace, melting and refining process and casting.
Location: Data relate to plants in the EU
Technology: Electric arc furnace for melting. Energy consumption and emissions from EAF steel making
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ea445393-9bd6-3cf6-932d-b73f3d415bce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
